Pink Pepper fit is a perceptual criterion, not chemical equivalence. Depth is not base mass. Sport motion is not intensity. Comfort is not liking.

## Stop / HOLD Rules

- Stop before compounding without separate physical authorization.
- HOLD Pink-Pepper carrier-matched stages until carrier and concentration basis are documented; the Helional ladder may still be designed but not physically run without separate authorization and stock verification.
- Stop the affected arm for phase separation, unexpected color/haze, damaged or oxidized stock, labeling mismatch, protocol error, or safety uncertainty.
- Reject a branch for repeated loss of Pink Pepper first-object identity, hot/dry pepper, literal rose/plum, generic sport/ambrox takeover, harshness, fatigue, or spatial/temporal collapse.
- Report `NO WINNER` when no arm satisfies the predeclared pattern; do not rescue it with unblinded reformulation or a numerical score.
- Blinded observations remain specific to the tested formula, bottle, concentration, medium, assessors, and conditions.

